# Line-ending policy (issue #1: a CRLF checkout breaks every shell script).
# Force LF in the repo AND in the working tree for everything bash/python/
# Klipper-config parses, so a Windows clone with core.autocrlf=true can
# never produce a broken katanaos.sh again.
* text=auto
*.sh text eol=lf
*.py text eol=lf
*.cfg text eol=lf
*.conf text eol=lf
